  "freeze_policy": "These bounds are a fixed contract. Adding a NEW territory INSIDE the ParanÃ¡ Atlantic-Forest ecoregion does NOT recompute goalposts and does NOT require re-running existing territories â€” the new territory is scored against the frozen bounds (HDI-style; OECD/JRC Composite Indicators Handbook). This preserves spatial AND temporal comparability.",
  "version_bump_rule": "Bump (vN+1, re-baseline) when EITHER (a) extending OUTSIDE the ParanÃ¡ Atlantic-Forest ecoregion (e.g. Gran Chaco biome: Chaco/Formosa) OR (b) deliberate methodological revision. A bump MUST recompute ALL territories AND the full historical series together AND document the break. Intra-ecoregion additions are NOT a bump. PLANNED v1.1: pool extended to full NEA + trans-boundary scope including Chaco/Formosa/ParanÃ¡-BR â€” break to be documented at execution.",
